---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../../../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout
	title="Congruence Criteria | Class 9 Triangles | The Concepts Adda"
	description="Learn congruence of triangles, CPCTC rule, and criteria SAS, ASA, AAS, SSS, RHS for Class 9 Mathematics (NCERT)."
>
	<main class="lesson-page">
		<div class="lesson-container">
			<a href="/class-9/triangles" class="back-link">
				<span class="back-arrow">←</span>
				<span>Back to Triangles</span>
			</a>

			<section class="lesson-header">
				<div class="lesson-number">01</div>
				<div class="lesson-header-copy">
					<div class="lesson-label">LESSON 01 · CLASS 9 MATHEMATICS (NCERT)</div>
					<h1>Congruence of Triangles <span>& Criteria</span></h1>
					<p>
						Master what it means for two triangles to be congruent (△ABC ≅ △PQR), the CPCTC rule, and all 5 congruence criteria.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="content-layout">
				<article class="lesson-content">
					<div class="topic-label">01 · CONGRUENCE & CPCTC</div>
					<h2>What is Congruence?</h2>
					<p>
						Two triangles are <strong>congruent</strong> if they have exactly the same shape and size. When △ABC ≅ △PQR:
						<br/>
						• <strong>CPCTC Rule:</strong> Corresponding Parts of Congruent Triangles are Congruent.
					</p>

					<div class="example-card">
						<div class="example-header">
							<span class="example-badge">CONGRUENCE CRITERIA</span>
							<h3>5 Congruence Rules</h3>
						</div>
						<div class="example-solution">
							<p>1. <strong>SAS (Side-Angle-Side):</strong> Two sides and the included angle of one triangle are equal to two sides and the included angle of another.</p>
							<p>2. <strong>ASA (Angle-Side-Angle):</strong> Two angles and the included side of one triangle are equal to two angles and the included side of another.</p>
							<p>3. <strong>AAS (Angle-Angle-Side):</strong> Two angles and a non-included side are equal.</p>
							<p>4. <strong>SSS (Side-Side-Side):</strong> Three sides of one triangle are equal to three sides of another triangle.</p>
							<p>5. <strong>RHS (Right angle-Hypotenuse-Side):</strong> Hypotenuse and one side of a right-angled triangle are equal to the hypotenuse and one side of another right-angled triangle.</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- NAVIGATION -->
					<div class="lesson-navigation">
						<a href="/class-9/triangles" class="previous-lesson">
							<span>←</span>
							<div>
								<small>OVERVIEW</small>
								<strong>Chapter Overview</strong>
							</div>
						</a>

						<a href="/class-9/triangles/isosceles-triangle-properties" class="next-lesson">
							<div>
								<small>NEXT LESSON</small>
								<strong>Isosceles Triangle Properties</strong>
							</div>
							<span>→</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- SIDEBAR -->
				<aside class="lesson-sidebar">
					<div class="sidebar-card">
						<div class="sidebar-title">TRIANGLES</div>
						<div class="progress-text">Lesson 01 of 03</div>
						<div class="progress-bar">
							<div style="width: 33.3%;"></div>
						</div>

						<div class="sidebar-lessons">
							<a href="/class-9/triangles/congruence-criteria" class="sidebar-lesson active">
								<span>01</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Congruence Criteria</strong>
									<small>SAS, ASA, SSS, RHS & CPCTC</small>
								</div>
							</a>

							<a href="/class-9/triangles/isosceles-triangle-properties" class="sidebar-lesson">
								<span>02</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Isosceles Properties</strong>
									<small>Equal sides & opposite angles</small>
								</div>
							</a>

							<a href="/class-9/triangles/pyqs" class="sidebar-lesson">
								<span>03</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Previous Year PYQs</strong>
									<small>Class 9 practice questions set</small>
								</div>
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</aside>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>

	<style>
		.lesson-page { min-height: 100vh; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fbff 0%, #ffffff 35%, #f7f9fc 100%); color: #14213d; padding: 45px 0 100px; }
		.lesson-container { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: 0 auto; }
		.back-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; color: #667085; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 35px; }
		.back-link:hover { color: #2563eb; }
		.lesson-header { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 25px; align-items: center; padding: 40px; border: 1px solid #e1e7f0; border-radius: 24px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92); box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.055); margin-bottom: 45px; }
		.lesson-number { width: 80px; height: 80px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 20px; background: #eef4ff; color: #2563eb; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; }
		.lesson-label { color: #2563eb; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: 1.7px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
		.lesson-header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 54px); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -2px; font-weight: 900; color: #14213d; }
		.lesson-header h1 span { color: #2563eb; }
		.lesson-header p { margin: 15px 0 0; max-width: 720px; color: #687180; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; }
		.content-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 300px; gap: 45px; align-items: start; }
		.lesson-content { min-width: 0; }
		.topic-label { color: #2563eb; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 1.8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
		.lesson-content h2 { margin: 0; color: #14213d; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 38px); letter-spacing: -1.5px; font-weight: 900; }
		.lesson-content > p { max-width: 780px; margin: 18px 0 0; color: #687180; font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.75; }
		.example-card { margin-top: 25px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #e1e7f0; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.035); overflow: hidden; }
		.example-header { padding: 20px 24px; background: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7; }
		.example-badge { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 6px; background: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
		.example-header h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #14213d; }
		.example-solution { padding: 24px; color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; }
		.lesson-navigation { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-top: 60px; padding-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
		.previous-lesson, .next-lesson { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 18px 24px; border: 1px solid #e1e7f0; border-radius: 16px; background: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; color: #14213d; transition: all 0.2s ease; }
		.next-lesson { margin-left: auto; text-align: right; }
		.previous-lesson:hover, .next-lesson:hover { border-color: #2563eb; transform: translateY(-2px); }
		.previous-lesson small, .next-lesson small { display: block; color: #64748b; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; }
		.previous-lesson strong, .next-lesson strong { display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
		.previous-lesson span, .next-lesson span { font-size: 20px; color: #2563eb; font-weight: 800; }
		.lesson-sidebar { position: sticky; top: 30px; }
		.sidebar-card { padding: 28px; border-radius: 24px; border: 1px solid #e1e7f0; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.04); }
		.sidebar-title { color: #2563eb; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
		.progress-text { color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; }
		.progress-bar { height: 6px; border-radius: 10px; background: #e2e8f0; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 24px; }
		.progress-bar div { height: 100%; background: #2563eb; border-radius: 10px; }
		.sidebar-lessons { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
		.sidebar-lesson { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px; text-decoration: none; color: #334155; }
		.sidebar-lesson.active { background: #eef4ff; }
		.sidebar-lesson > span { width: 24px; height: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 6px; background: #f1f5f9; color: #64748b; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; }
		.sidebar-lesson.active > span { background: #dbeafe; color: #2563eb; }
		.sidebar-lesson strong { display: block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b; }
		.sidebar-lesson small { display: block; font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 3px; }
		@media (max-width: 900px) { .content-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .lesson-header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 28px; } .lesson-navigation { flex-direction: column; } }
	</style>
</Layout>
